sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Dashboard
    participant API
    participant DB
    participant AI
    
    User->>Dashboard: Login
    Dashboard->>API: POST /api/auth/login
    API->>DB: Verify credentials
    DB-->>API: User data
    API-->>Dashboard: JWT token
    
    User->>Dashboard: Select flight
    Dashboard->>API: GET /api/flights/{id}
    API->>DB: Query flight data
    DB-->>API: Telemetry data
    API-->>Dashboard: Flight data
    
    Dashboard->>API: POST /api/anomalies/detect
    API->>AI: Send telemetry
    AI->>AI: Run Isolation Forest
    AI-->>API: Anomaly scores
    API->>DB: Store anomalies
    API-->>Dashboard: Anomaly results
